### Front-end API examples (Search Service)
#
# Run them from IntelliJ (green arrow next to each request) or copy them to curl.
# Prepare the datamart with the five sample books first:
#   java -cp search-service/target/search-service-1.0.0.jar com.zcj.search.SampleDataSeeder sample_data
#   java -jar search-service/target/search-service-1.0.0.jar
#
# The expected result of each request is written above it.
# The same checks run automatically in search-service/src/test/java/com/zcj/search/SearchApiTest.java

@search = http://localhost:7003

### Keyword search -> 200, total 1: book 1342, hits 432
GET {{search}}/search?q=darcy

### Several words (AND) -> 200: books 84 and 98, ordered by hits
GET {{search}}/search?q=monster%20creature

### Filter by author -> 200: only 1342
GET {{search}}/search?q=love&author=austen

### Filter by language -> 200, total 5
GET {{search}}/search?q=the&language=en

### Filter by year -> 200: only 1342
GET {{search}}/search?q=the&year=1998

### Combined filters -> 200: only 1661
GET {{search}}/search?q=the&author=doyle&language=en&year=1999

### Valid query without matches -> 200, total 0, results []
GET {{search}}/search?q=zzzzqx

### Pagination, page 1 -> 200, total 5, 2 results (books 98 and 1661)
GET {{search}}/search?q=the&offset=0&limit=2

### Pagination, page 2 -> 200, total 5, the next 2 results
GET {{search}}/search?q=the&offset=2&limit=2

### Page beyond the end -> 200, total 5, results []
GET {{search}}/search?q=the&offset=10&limit=2

### Missing q -> 400 invalid_parameter
GET {{search}}/search

### q without letters -> 400 invalid_parameter
GET {{search}}/search?q=123

### limit out of range -> 400 invalid_parameter
GET {{search}}/search?q=the&limit=500

### year not an integer -> 400 invalid_parameter
GET {{search}}/search?q=the&year=nineteen

### Invalid language code -> 400 invalid_parameter
GET {{search}}/search?q=the&language=english

### Book details -> 200: Pride and Prejudice
GET {{search}}/books/1342

### Unknown book -> 404 not_found
GET {{search}}/books/999999

### Invalid book id -> 400 invalid_parameter
GET {{search}}/books/abc

### Filter values -> 200: languages, years and authors with their number of books
GET {{search}}/search/filters

### Health check -> 200
GET {{search}}/status
